# Live Demo

This demo uses the real WVST bridge path. It does not create mock effects when the bridge, browser isolation, or local VST plugins are unavailable.

<WVSTRackDemo locale="en" />

## Requirements

- The docs page must be served from localhost or HTTPS with cross-origin isolation headers.
- `wvst-bridge-server` must be running on the endpoint shown in the demo.
- Mounted plugins should be effect-style VST3 classes that can process stereo input and output.
